% ATL-PHYS-PUB-2016-009 fig_01 (row 1, right pair, amplitude: qg -> q H(-> gamma gamma), t-channel gluon into a quark triangle)
layout: v2
in: q1 g2
out: q2 a1 a2
q1 -- [fermion] v -- [fermion] q2
v -- [gluon] t1
